      "title": "packet-gsm_abis_oml: dissect Get Attribute Response Info",
      "message": "packet-gsm_abis_oml: dissect Get Attribute Response Info\n\nThe Get Attribute Response Info contains attributes requested by the\nGet Attributes message. It contains the same attributes which can be part\nan OML message.\n",
      "author_name": "Alexander Couzens",
      "author_email": "lynxis@fe80.eu",
      "authored_date": "2020-11-28T03:04:43.000+01:00",
